    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it just feels different this time. i've always been the one who had it together, the one who succeeded. now i'm just the kid who messed up everything. it feels like there's this version of me that everyone loves, and that version is dead. i don't think i can ever fix that. everything just feels so heavy, and it feels like there's no real way to get back to how things were.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
